 as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="965" y="306" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선n6" value="스레드풀도 큐도 없다 → 거부될 곳이 사라졌다.&lt;br&gt;invoke 가 수십 ms 라 요청 스레드에서 그대로 부른다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F0FBF3;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="285" width="340" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e7" value="claim: UPDATE started_at" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="965" y="350" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="755" y="350" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e8" value="invoke( InvocationType.EVENT )" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="965" y="394" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1175" y="394" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e9" value="202 Accepted  (수십 ms)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1175" y="438" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="965" y="438" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선n10" value="한도를 넘긴 초과분은 429 가 아니라&lt;br&gt;Lambda 내부 큐에서 대기·재시도된다.&lt;br&gt;처리량이 는 게 아니라 초과분을 안 버리게 된 것." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F0FBF3;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="409" width="340" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e11" value="202 Accepted  { jobId, PENDING }" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="335" y="482" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="125" y="482" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선d12" value="여기서 요청은 끝난다. 아래는 전부 비동기 구간" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=bottom;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="30" y="526" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1900" y="526" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선s13" value="합성 실행 (7.9초)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#D05C17;fontColor=#D05C17;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1175" y="570" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1175" y="596" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1245" y="570"/><mxPoint x="1245" y="596"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e14" value="Destination 통지  { requestContext.condition, requestPayload }" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#D05C17;fontColor=#D05C17;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1175" y="658" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1385" y="658" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선n15" value="보내는 주체가 함수가 아니라 Lambda 서비스다.&lt;br&gt;스로틀·이벤트 만료처럼 함수가 아예 안 도는 실패까지 통지가 온다.&lt;br&gt;requestPayload 에 우리가 보낸 jobId 가 그대로 실려 온다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF7F0;strokeColor=#D05C17;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="629" width="340" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e16" value="ReceiveMessage( WaitTimeSeconds=20, Max=10 )" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="702" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1385" y="702" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e17" value="통지 메시지" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1385" y="746" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1595" y="746" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선s18" value="condition 으로 분기 (enum 아닌 String 수신)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="790" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1595" y="816" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1665" y="790"/><mxPoint x="1665" y="816"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e19" value="Success  →  completeJob()  →  status = DONE" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="878" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="755" y="878" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e20" value="RetriesExhausted  →  failJob()  →  status = FAILED" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#C53030;fontColor=#C53030;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="922" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="755" y="922" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e21" value="그 외(EventAgeExceeded 등)  →  아무 조치 없음" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="966" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="755" y="966" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선n22" value="이 설계의 요지.&lt;br&gt;미지의 값을 FAILED 로 적으면 재시도 가능한 실패가&lt;br&gt;영구 손실이 된다 (개선 전 429 가 죽던 방식).&lt;br&gt;PENDING 으로 두면 아래 스케줄러가 회수한다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F0FBF3;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="929" width="340" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e23" value="DeleteMessage  (처리 성공 시에만)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="1010" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1385" y="1010" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선n24" value="처리 실패 시 일부러 안 지운다.&lt;br&gt;가시성 타임아웃 뒤 재전달되고 5회 실패하면 DLQ 로 간다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F0FBF3;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="989" width="340" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e25" value="findStalled( PENDING + stale-after 10분 경과 )" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1805" y="1054" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="755" y="1054" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e26" value="rerun( ComposeRequestedEvent )  →  재투입" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1805" y="1098" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="965" y="1098" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선n27" value="stale-after 10분 = 이벤트 수명 5분 + 함수 타임아웃 60초 + 여유.&lt;br&gt;1번 재시도(Lambda 내부 큐)가 끝난 뒤에 2번이 돌도록 역산했다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F0FBF3;strokeColor=#6DB33F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="1077" width="340" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="개선d28" value="사용자는 그동안 폴링으로 상태를 본다" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=bottom;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="30" y="1142" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1900" y="1142" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e29" value="GET /compose/{jobId}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="125" y="1186" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="335" y="1186" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="개선e30" value="status: PENDING | DONE | FAILED" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="335" y="1230" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="125" y="1230" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>